                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>QC Organic Orders: </run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>No. of QC Orders without any incentives</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>QC Disco MAU: </run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>No. of Customers with at least 1 QC Disco Order</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>QC Other Incentives MAU: </run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>No. of Customers with at least 1 QC Incentivized Order (excluding QC Disco MAU)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>QC Organic MAU: </run>
